[1m[38;5;231mWhich architecture should I design against?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Core + adapters (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mPure testable core (levels, shaping, allowlist) plus thin browser/Node adapters. Four small files, no deps, no [39m
     [38;5;246mbuild step.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Single-file logger
     [38;5;246mOne universal logger.js, transports registered at init. Fastest to build; redaction is harder to test in isolation.
[39m  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: Migrate repo to ESM
     [38;5;246mReal imports across both runtimes. Cleanest modules, but a repo-wide migration and index.html stops working over [39m
